flowchart TD
  discover[Discovery<br/>literature_search and databases] --> resolve[paper_resolve<br/>one stable identity]
  resolve --> get[paper_get<br/>merged metadata + BibTeX]
  get --> integrity[integrity_check<br/>retracted, corrected, clean, unknown]
  get --> download[paper_download<br/>Unpaywall and OA fallbacks]
  get --> context[paper_context<br/>focused sections/snippets]

  context -.->|lead, verify| quote[quote_check and trace<br/>verbatim evidence]

  download -->|open-access PDF| ingest[PaperMemory ingest<br/>content-addressed markdown]
  download -->|paywalled| paywall[Report paywalled<br/>list every source tried]
  download --> convert[pdf_to_markdown<br/>headings, tables, reading order]
  convert -->|text-based| ingest
  convert -->|scanned| vision[OCR or subagent_vision]

  ingest --> fold[paper_fold<br/>section map first]
  ingest --> quote
  fold --> read[Read one section at a time]
  read --> quote

  quote --> cite[cite and manuscript_citations<br/>keys only from memory]
  integrity --> cite
  ingest --> agent[Paper2Agent<br/>optional: paper skill + MCP server]

  classDef discovery fill:#eef2ff,stroke:#6366f1,color:#312e81
  classDef evidence fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#059669,color:#064e3b
  classDef warn fill:#fff7ed,stroke:#f97316,color:#7c2d12
  classDef optional fill:#f8fafc,stroke:#94a3b8,color:#0f172a
  class discover,get,context,download,convert,fold,read discovery
  class ingest,quote,cite evidence
  class paywall,vision warn
  class resolve,integrity,agent optional
